    "created_at": "2016-04-07T12:43:42Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-04-07T12:43:42Z",
    "body": "As I wrote earlier it depends on how you work with attributes. But in practice attrs not participates in tree so you don't get mixed other nodes with attrs, you don't have to verify attrs. And there are plans to stop inherits Attr from Node (still discussion https://github.com/whatwg/dom/issues/102). Start thinking about the attributes not as the nodes because it was a mistake which is hard to correct now.\n",
